[00:57.840]I cannot know your heart
[00:58.350]He’s like a swath
[01:00.090]Of vanished ocean
[01:00.390]The flowers on the shore, they brim with fire
[01:06.570]Yet I cannot
[01:10.560]Pick them
[01:46.380]I cannot touch your blood
[01:53.040]She’s like
[01:56.070]A wounded tree
[02:03.000]The body of the Earth struggling
[02:13.290]Yet I can only
[02:19.710]Keep weeping
[04:34.080]I am not a mother
[04:37.980]I am not a father
[04:41.550]My heart
[04:44.310]Is but a heart
[04:48.120]I am not a thing
[04:51.570]I am breathing now
[04:54.900]I am worthy
[04:58.110]Of my life
[05:01.470]I let loose the hard rains
[05:04.740]I let loose destiny
[05:08.100]There are so many things
[05:11.370]That still I cannot say
[05:14.700]I am in the world
[05:18.120]I am in time
[05:21.480]I am in the past
[05:24.630]I am now
[05:27.900]I run toward the wilds
[05:31.320]I run towards the distance
[05:34.620]There’s a voice
[05:37.740]Oh so familiar
[05:41.230]Lalala....
[05:59.550]Every flake of snow
[06:02.640]Imitates
[06:06.000]Every step I take toward you in devotion
[06:12.840]Your gaze covers me
[06:27.600]At last, we
[06:32.790]Bid farewell to time
[06:50.167]
